AltoMarket::setDebtCeiling
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
└── when caller is owner 
    ├── when market is not paused
    │   ├── it should accrue interest
    │   ├── it should update totalSupply assets
    │   ├── it should emit SetDebtCeiling event
    │   └── when totalSupply assets is greater than debt ceiling
    │       └── it should revert
    └── when market is paused
        ├── it should not accrue interest
        ├── it should accrue interest
        ├── it should update totalSupply assets
        └── it should emit SetDebtCeiling event